          "id": 2218509566,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Could the preference name be added to the warning message ([epan/proto.c](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/proto.c#L137)):  \n`\"Adding %s would put more than %d items in the tree -- possible infinite loop (max number of items can be increased in advanced preferences)\"`  \n`\"Adding %s would put more than %d items in the tree -- possible infinite loop (max number of items can be increased in advanced preferences - gui.max_tree_items)\"`  \n  \nOr add related text (\"Possible infinite loop\") to the preference tooltip ([epan/prefs.c](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/prefs.c#L3588)) for searching:  \n`\"The maximum number of items that can be added to the dissection tree (Increase with caution)\"`  \nAdd text:  \n`\"The maximum number of items that can be added to the dissection tree (Possible infinite loop - increase with caution)\"`",
